@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Same key and payload can be sent repeatedly
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

{"customerId":1,"restaurantId":7,"totalAmount":249.50}

### Conflict, not a second order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1

{"customerId":1,"restaurantId":7,"totalAmount":250}

### Replace ID with the actual create result
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### First cursor page
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?customerId=1&limit=2

### Lesson 10: inspect Catalog menu for Tadka Indiranagar (restaurant 7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/restaurants/7/menu

### Lesson 10: place item-based order using ICatalogModule price quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-1

{"customerId":51,"restaurantId":7,"items":[{"menuItemId":101,"quantity":2}]}

### Lesson 10: change Paneer Tikka price from 240.00 to 290.00
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/catalog/restaurants/7/items/101
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":290.00}

### Lesson 10: order receipt keeps the 240.00 snapshot price
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/receipt

### Lesson 10 negative control: naive cross-schema join drifts to 580.00
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/naive-join-receipt

### Lesson 10: restore Paneer Tikka price to 240.00
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/catalog/restaurants/7/items/101
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":240.00}
